+### REQ-PIPELINE-6715: Exact Replay Rows Own The Audit Gate
+
+Exp6715 SHALL reduce `exact_replay_audit_passed` only from raw precondition,
+manifest, cap, edge, enumeration, comparison, test, artifact-validation, row-
